# Always merge to master

For this project (Das-web / dasdev.net portfolio):

- After finishing a feature branch, **merge into `master` and push** without waiting to be asked.
- Prefer `master` as the integration branch (not only opening a PR and stopping).
- Feature branches may still be used for work, but shipping means: merge → push `origin/master`.
- Do not leave completed work only on a feature branch.
